    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0a327a0a2c31b0724606666",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "致训练员\\nHappy Valentine's Day!\\n今年也做了珍藏的点心哦。\\n因为曲奇是很耐保存的，所以我也在里面倾注\\n了“希望能永远一起奔跑下去”的祈祷",
      "source_fingerprint": "317e7005a42ca6393425317e0c39456a954da0dd93b4cb1d0418fc82d53e1319",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
