    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fd1d5838a479428f3f0e6c1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "致训练员：\\n在一族伟大的历史之中，\\n我想与你一同刻下，名为最强的年轮。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49dee58684d2be7151704e8100b918e5dc222e9fb19cb8d787a58c437495c30b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "271",
        "110801"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/271/110801"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bdc5842dbcbe37f8c2b8b85",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了能在训练员的心中，\\n留下永恒的雀跃感……\\n这是闪闪发光、暖洋洋的宝物盒！\\n注意：挂件是不可以吃的哦×\\n作为交换，我们会一直在一起◎",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c24e5bbe03d6e713dfb0e4d87ba766ab3075075c941fd59186b0d8c893de244",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "271",
        "110901"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/271/110901"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b65151b040dac150b565407d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了能在训练员的心中，\\n留下永恒的雀跃感……\\n这是闪闪发光、暖洋洋的宝物盒！\\n注意：挂件是不可以吃的哦×\\n作为交换，我们会一直在一起◎",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c24e5bbe03d6e713dfb0e4d87ba766ab3075075c941fd59186b0d8c893de244",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
