    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22b53bc532c986ab94e8585d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "故乡的雪总是宁静无声、纯洁无暇、\\n只会默然地为大地铺上白衣。这是我心中最为重要的景色，\\n所以……我想让您也看看那般风光。\\n从今往后，我也会奔向那景色的更远方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2419f0fb3bc48c9e1b955a618217e518b73f443afc9392d68fd3b8a198bf69e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "272",
        "100201"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/272/100201"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3915cc4497f23273eb296305",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "故乡的雪总是宁静无声、纯洁无暇，只会默然地为\\n大地铺上白衣。这是我心中最为重要的景色，\\n所以……我想让您也看看那般风光。\\n从今往后，我也会奔向那景色的更远方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2cebd7262df809b5d63d7942cae9e8026c8dc07539fe739ea3498967f8b6c43",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
